# evigene exposes itself through an environment variable, not PATH. Its recipe
# ships etc/conda/activate.d/evigene-<ver>.sh setting EVIGENEHOME, and all 891 of
# its files live under opt/evigene-<ver>/ with nothing in bin/. That is upstream's
# deliberate design, not a packaging bug — EVIGENEHOME IS set in our images, and
# the scripts run from $EVIGENEHOME/scripts/.
#
# So there is no binary to name here. This file exists to record WHY the gate
# cannot prove evigene the usual way, so nobody re-reports it as broken; the
# functional check below is what actually proves it.
